# Legacy flat football URLs that Google still has indexed. paul365 moved to
# /football/<country>/<league>/ but these old paths still receive crawler
# hits; without a redirect CF Pages was serving the homepage HTML for them,
# which made Google canonicalise the old URL to the homepage and treat it
# as duplicate content. 301 to the real location.
/football/italy-serie-a/ /football/italy/italy-serie-a/ 301
/football/spain-la-liga/ /football/spain/spain-primera-liga/ 301
/football/uefa-champions-league/ /football/uefa/uefa-champions-league/ 301

